# Layout

{% if shape == 'general' %}
The files that every repository of the template's general shape holds are laid out once, in
sdk-template's README,
[The general part of a repository](https://github.com/xippios/sdk-template/blob/main/README.md#the-general-part-of-a-repository).
This file holds what `xippios-{{ source_slug }}` adds to them, a module, a script or a test of
its own, each with what it holds, and the change that adds one updates it.
{% else %}
The files that every source of the family holds are laid out once, in the tree of
sdk-template's README,
[What gets generated](https://github.com/xippios/sdk-template/blob/main/README.md#what-gets-generated).
This file holds what `xippios-{{ source_slug }}` adds to that tree, a module, a task file, a
script or a test of its own, each with what it holds, and the change that adds one updates it.
{% endif %}

The import path is `xippios.{{ import_path }}` (sdk-core ADR-0006); `src/xippios/` is a
namespace package{% if '/' in package_dir %}, and so is `src/xippios/{{ package_dir.rsplit('/', 1)[0] }}/`, the provider level{% endif %}.
